      "text": "## Withdrawal Deadlines and Financial Obligations\n\nThis page outlines the approved deadlines for withdrawal from the University or from registered courses, as well as the applicable tuition fee refund percentages based on the date the withdrawal or registration suspension request is submitted, in accordance with the approved policies and procedures of United Arab Emirates University (UAEU).\n\nWithdrawal or Registration Suspension Procedures\n\n1. Submit the Request\n\n* + Students must submit a request to withdraw from the University, withdraw from a course, or suspend their registration through the eService system within the designated period.\n\n2. Review Financial Obligations and Refund Eligibility\n\n* + The student’s financial obligations and applicable tuition fee refund percentage are determined based on the date the request is submitted.\n\n3. Complete the Required Procedures\n\n* + Withdrawal procedures must be completed in accordance with the University’s approved regulations and procedures. Any eligible refund, where applicable, will be processed after the student has completed all required clearance procedures.\n  + If the request is submitted after the applicable deadline, the student will remain responsible for the full tuition fees due, and no tuition fee refund will be granted in accordance with the approved refund schedule.\n\nWithdrawal Refund and Mandatory Payment Schedule First Semester 2026–2027\n\n###### Courses Under the Full-Semester System\n\n| Status | Start Date | End Date | Payment Refund % | Payment Pledge % |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Course Withdrawal | 24 August 2026 | 18 September 2026 | 100% | 0% |\n\nNote: After 18 September 2026, students will be responsible for paying 100% of the applicable tuition fees in the event of course withdrawal or registration suspension.\n\n###### Courses Under the Monthly System First Month\n\n| Status | Start Date | End Date | Payment Refund % | Payment Pledge % |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Course Withdrawal | 24 August 2026 | 30 August 2026 | 100% | 0% |\n\nNote: After 30 August 2026, students will be responsible for paying 100% of the applicable tuition fees in the event of course withdrawal or registration suspension.\n\nSecond Month\n\n| Status | Start Date | End Date | Payment Refund % | Payment Pledge % |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Course Withdrawal | 24 August 2026 | 27 September 2026 | 100% | 0% |\n\nNote: After 27 September 2026, students will be responsible for paying 100% of the applicable tuition fees in the event of course withdrawal or registration suspension.\n\nThird Month\n\n| Status | Start Date | End Date | Payment Refund % | Payment Pledge % |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Course Withdrawal | 24 August 2026 | 25 October 2026 | 100% | 0% |\n\nNote: After 25 October 2026, students will be responsible for paying 100% of the applicable tuition fees in the event of course withdrawal or registration suspension.  \nFourth Month\n\n| Status | Start Date | End Date | Payment Refund % | Payment Pledge % |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Course Withdrawal | 24 August 2026 | 22 November 2026 | 100% | 0% |\n\nNote: After 22 November 2026, students will be responsible for paying 100% of the applicable tuition fees in the event of course withdrawal or registration suspension.\n\nCourses Under the Quarterly System for Each Semester\n\nFirst Quarter\n\n| Status | Start Date | End Date | Payment Refund % | Payment Pledge % |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Course Withdrawal | 24 August 2026 | 06 September 2026 | 100% | 0% |\n\nNote: After 6 September 2026, students will be responsible for paying 100% of the applicable tuition fees in the event of course withdrawal or registration suspension.\n\nSecond Quarter\n\n| Status | Start Date | End Date | Payment Refund % | Payment Pledge % |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Course Withdrawal | 24 August 2026 | 01 November 2026 | 100% | 0% |\n\nNote: After 